## Interface: 20506
## Title: BiS Healing |cff808080(Forever edition - inactive here)|r
## Notes: The WoW Forever edition. It loads nothing in this client, on purpose.
## Author: Kumlust

# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS (20 Sep 2026). A TBC client picks BiSHealing_TBC.toc over BiSHealing.toc
# when both are present - learned from RestedXP, which ships one TOC per flavour. The base TOC
# claims TBC as well as Forever, so without this file the Forever addon loaded in TBC, found the
# OLD BiS Healing's saved table, and emptied it: 4,039 fight records in one logout.
#
# So on TBC this folder loads ONE file, which only says what this is. No SavedVariables are
# declared here on purpose: this TOC must never be in a position to read or write BiSHealingDB,
# which belongs to BiS Healing (TBC) on this client.
#
# No ## Version either - the base TOC is the only place the version lives, and a second copy is a
# second thing to forget to bump.
TBC.lua
